user notes help (under settings)

things you will need    |   where to find them
================================================
1) your username        |   settings page (here)
2) song file name       |   at the bottom of the song you want to add notes to. 
                            it will end in .html eg Something.html
                            
open 00-template.user.json in a simple plain text editor (eg notepad) save it as 
song_file_name.username.json
follow the template to edit. use a seperate json (notes) file for each song file (html)
when happy, save and refresh.
                            
